60px !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-275ac88{padding-left:0px !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-275ac88{padding-right:0px !important;padding-bottom:30px !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-275ac88-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-275ac88-inner-blocks\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote has-teal-color has-text-color is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-60a5574\" data-block-id=\"60a5574\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text has-text-align-center\"><em>\u201cA species capable enough to cause climate change, is also capable enough to cease climate change, but only if we realize our mistakes in time \u2013 and that time is now, because later will be too late.\u201d<\/em> <em>Abhijit Naskar<\/em><\/p><\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Markus Spiske\/ Unsplash. Global climate change protesters hold signs\" class=\"wp-image-3683 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-356x200.jpg 356w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/07\/markus-spiske-dYZumbs8f_E-unsplash-2-200x113.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/576;\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-b681efe\" data-block-id=\"b681efe\"><style>.stk-b681efe{padding-right:30px !important;padding-left:30px !important}@media screen and (max-width:1023px){.stk-b681efe{padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;margin-right:0px !important;margin-left:0px !important}}@media screen and (max-width:767px){.stk-b681efe{padding-right:0px !important;padding-left:0px !important;margin-right:0px !important;margin-left:0px !important}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-b681efe-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-bab902f\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"bab902f\"><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-bab902f-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-bab902f-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Evidence of our impact on the climate is all around us. Severe flooding has destroyed homes and livelihoods; forest fires and heatwaves have devestated land and communities, the Atlantic gulf stream is showing signs of reversing potentially causing plummeting temperatures in mild Northern Europe countries.&nbsp; Each successive IPCC report is a more alarming read.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our future is not climate warming, it is climate turmoil.&nbsp; Radical change could come very quickly with a cascade of \u201ctipping points\u201d where one triggers the next leading, not just to a change in climate, but to social turmoil and climate generated conflict.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are now have evidence of the incontrovertibility of disruptive climate change, but the urgency of taking radical measures to ameliorate the change is challenged. CCAC deplores the delay of prevarication.&nbsp; We look to the future when the pupils we work with may have children of their own.&nbsp; Our message is that climate change is a global concern which needs global action.&nbsp; We should be taking all possible measures to reduce impacts.&nbsp; However there seems little chance of stopping it in its tracks and that significant disruption is inevitable.&nbsp; We provide the children with the tools to understanding the issues and the means to envisage imaginative and effective accommodation of a turbulent but potentially transformative climate future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>About Climate turmoil \u201cA species capable enough to cause climate change, is also capable enough to cease climate change, but only if we realize our mistakes in time \u2013 and that time is now, because later will be too late.\u201d Abhijit Naskar Evidence of our impact on the climate is all around us. Severe flooding [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":2625,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2633","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Climate turmoil - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta n